       (forward :forward-only t :tokens-to-generate 512)
       (deref))))
```

We invoke `model/forward`, with `:forward-only t` (this is how the underlying library, `huggingface-clj` is configured), and `:tokens-to-generate 512`, which is the number of tokens to generate, and the `deref` dereferences the promise that is immediately returned by `forward` to wait for the result. Now let's look at the code `huggingface-clj`:

