The Balance/ Cap graph is used to determine the starting cap.

After creating the reserve of BNT, you can determine the reserve ratio (CRR) with the dropdown. Your choice will determine the degree of volatility.

Now you have to click launch and stake the ETH fees to get the new token. Verification and Configuration follows and then the contract will be published

After all the above steps have been taken, Bancor will now have access and rights to accept trader converted ETH and conversion of these tokens to others on the platform through smart contracts

